do_2 = "Capture existing dependency resolution/integrity, public exports and bins, workspace/test membership, native component discovery, current runtime paths and relevant baseline check outcomes. Preserve absent/failed prerequisite evidence explicitly instead of treating it as a successful baseline."
do_3 = "Implement the inventory/dry-run consumer to produce old-to-new path and content/mode manifests, direct-consumer rewrite obligations, installed-artifact versus source-path classifications, historical path exceptions and a reversible move plan. Do not move files in this task."
do_4 = "Implement the task driver against actual tracked manifests and source rules; prove detection of missing mapping, duplicate destinations, unexpected identity/dependency changes and source/artifact path confusion. Record approved target layout generation and baseline inputs for subsequent moves."
