do_3 = "Close an exact contract/source/toolchain/manifest/interface/provider assertion inventory with actual execution evidence. Classify baseline defects and missing backend/provider coverage explicitly; a parser-only or scripted planner run cannot qualify agent-led orchestration."
do_4 = "Publish the local prerequisite handoff contract and source-adapter migration boundary, preserve receipts and recovery instructions, and release native task 0.1 only after complete 0.14 qualification; native task 0.2 later imports these historical receipts without rewriting them."

