do_3 = "Separate immutable revision creation from optional preferred-change references and acceptance domain state. Expose concurrent revisions as divergence and preserve earlier objects; revision creation must not acquire an existing run-wide assurance/advisory lock or increment a repository-wide counter."
do_4 = "Persist the committed result and source outbox in the same transaction. Implement pending delivery claims, durable acknowledgments and per-aggregate/inbox deduplication without relying on insertion-sequence order; bootstrap binds an authorized immutable source manifest and replay boundary."
